## Usage

```bash
{{ project.repository_name }} --help
{{ project.repository_name }} hello
{{ project.repository_name }} hello Ada
```

`python -m {{ project.package_name }}` behaves identically to the
`{{ project.repository_name }}` console script.

## Project structure

```text
src/{{ project.package_name }}/   Package source
tests/                            Test suite
```

Add new commands as functions decorated with `@app.command()` in
`src/{{ project.package_name }}/cli.py`.
